  unitName: Merciful Beacon Charla
  unitId: 50836
  unitNumber: 1152
  description: As the gods continued their merciless killing of countless innocents
    throughout the war, Charla finally revealed her role as a priestess of La Veda,
    and officially revolted against the gods. Shortly afterwards, Charla recruited
    a group of warrior priests to protect her people as they fled to the new promised
    land. As their leader, she chose to fight at the vanguard to eliminate any incoming
    threats from the gods. Although the other priests tried to convince her to flee
    with them as the war drew to a close, she chose to stay and fight in order to
    atone for her self-proclaimed heresy.
  summonDesc: I believed in the gods till the end,<br>but wanted to save people even
    more.<br>I shall pay for all my sins!
  fusionDesc: The comfort the light brings...<br>I thought it would last forever...<br>But
    that's all in the past now...
  evoDesc: I shall be your sword!<br>I will point this blade<br>at all of your enemies!
  element: 5
  rarity: 6
